OpenForWrite, Write(one), Write( two), Close: Read() = [one two]
WriteLine(first), WriteLine(second): Read() ends each line = true
OpenForWrite again replaces the contents: Read() = [fresh]
OpenForWriteAppend, Write( and more): Read() = [fresh and more]
OpenForWriteAppend on a missing file makes it: Read() = [made]
PushToDisk() before Close: Read() = [buffered]
File:OpenForWrite, Write, File:Close: Read() = [through File]
File:OpenForWriteAppend, Write, File:Close: Read() = [through File appended]
File:OpenForWrite on a folder is undefined = true
File:OpenForWriteAppend on a folder is undefined = true
OpenForWrite(a file in a missing folder) fails, as it should
